<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="重庆市早舟科技有限公司，聚焦职业教育、产教融合、产业学院建设、学校内涵建设与AI赋能教育。">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b243b">
  <title>早舟科技｜职业教育与产教融合解决方案</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0b243b;
      --navy-light: #163955;
      --orange: #ed8427;
      --orange-dark: #d96f16;
      --cream: #f4efe5;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #243442;
      --muted: #697985;
      --line: rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.12);
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.12);
      --radius: 22px;
      --container: 1180px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button,
    input,
    textarea {
      font: inherit;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--container));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      color: var(--white);
      background: rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.94);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 74px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--orange);
      border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 3px;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .nav-cta,
    .button {
      min-height: 46px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .nav-cta,
    .button-primary {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    .nav-cta:hover,
    .button-primary:hover {
      background: var(--orange-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      color: var(--white);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 720px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--white);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 25%, rgba(237, 132, 39, 0.22), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #071a2b 0%, var(--navy) 55%, #174565 100%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 70px;
      padding: 92px 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      width: 28px;
      height: 2px;
      content: "";
      background: currentColor;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    p {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 20px 0 24px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 76px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .hero-panel {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 470px;
      padding: 26px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      border-radius: 34px;
      box-shadow: 0 35px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .visual-main {
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 418px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 30px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 25%, rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.88) 100%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #315d79, #102f46);
      border-radius: 24px;
    }

    .visual-label {
      align-self: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: auto;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--cream);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .visual-main strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .visual-main p {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    }

    section {
      padding: 110px 0;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin: 14px 0 16px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.18;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .solutions {
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .solution-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .solution-card {
      min-height: 280px;
      padding: 34px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.06);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.06);
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .solution-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card-number {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .solution-card h3 {
      margin: 36px 0 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .solution-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .card-link {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .advantages-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 70px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .advantage-visual {
      min-height: 500px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 42px;
      color: var(--white);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(11, 36, 59, 0.92)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #e7aa70, var(--orange));
      border-radius: 28px;
    }

    .advantage-visual strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .advantage-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .advantage-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 23px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .advantage-icon {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--orange);
      background: rgba(237, 132, 39, 0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .advantage-item h3 {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .advantage-item p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .content-section {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--navy);
    }

    .content-section .section-heading h2 {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .content-section .section-heading p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    }

    .content-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .content-card {
      min-height: 320px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 34px;
      background: var(--navy-light);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .content-card.accent {
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    .content-card span {
      margin-bottom: auto;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .content-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .content-card p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }

    .contact {
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .contact-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
      padding: 58px;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--navy);
      border-radius: 30px;
    }

    .contact-box h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 34px 0;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
      background: #061725;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .hero-grid,
      .advantages-grid,
      .content-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        gap: 45px;
        padding: 72px 0;
      }

      .hero-panel {
        min-height: 390px;
      }

      .visual-main {
        min-height: 338px;
      }

      .solution-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .contact-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        width: min(calc(100% - 28px), var(--container));
      }

      .nav {
        min-height: 66px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
      }

      .nav-cta {
        min-height: 40px;
        padding: 0 15px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 76px 0;
      }

      .hero-panel,
      .solution-card {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .advantage-visual {
        min-height: 360px;
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .footer-row {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      * {
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="早舟科技首页">
        <span class="brand-mark">早</span>
        <span>早舟科技</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="主导航">
        <a href="#home">首页</a>
        <a href="#solutions">解决方案</a>
        <a href="#advantages">核心能力</a>
        <a href="#insights">内容中心</a>
        <a href="#contact">关于我们</a>
      </nav>

      <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">业务咨询</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Education · Industry · Innovation</span>
          <h1>让教育与产业真正连接</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            重庆市早舟科技有限公司聚焦职业教育与产教融合，
            围绕产业学院、学校内涵建设和AI赋能教育，
            为院校与合作伙伴提供具有长期价值的解决方案。
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#solutions">了解解决方案</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="#contact">预约沟通</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-panel" aria-label="业务形象展示区域">
          <div class="visual-main">
            <span class="visual-label">原网站核心图片替换区域</span>
            <div>
              <strong>面向未来的教育创新实践</strong>
              <p>连接院校、产业、人才与技术，共同创造可持续价值。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="solutions" id="solutions">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span>
          <h2>围绕院校发展需求，构建系统化解决方案</h2>
          <p>
            从战略规划到项目落地，从专业建设到人才培养，
            以更清晰的业务结构帮助访客快速找到对应服务。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="solution-grid">
          <article class="solution-card">
            <span class="card-number">01 / INDUSTRY</span>
            <h3>产教融合</h3>
            <p>促进教育链、人才链与产业链协同，探索校企合作和协同育人的落地路径。</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="#contact">咨询相关方案 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="solution-card">
            <span class="card-number">02 / COLLEGE</span>
            <h3>产业学院建设</h3>
            <p>围绕产业需求与学校定位，提供产业学院规划、建设及持续运营支持。</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="#contact">咨询相关方案 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="solution-card">
            <span class="card-number">03 / DEVELOPMENT</span>
            <h3>学校内涵建设</h3>
            <p>服务专业、课程、师资与人才培养体系建设，推动院校形成长期发展能力。</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="#contact">咨询相关方案 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="solution-card">
            <span class="card-number">04 / AI EDUCATION</span>
            <h3>AI赋能教育</h3>
            <p>探索人工智能在教学、管理、资源建设和人才培养过程中的实际应用。</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="#contact">咨询相关方案 →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="advantages">
      <div class="container advantages-grid">
        <div class="advantage-visual">
          <strong>不只提供方案，<br>更关注方案如何落地。</strong>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">Capabilities</span>
            <h2>以专业能力支撑项目全过程</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="advantage-list">
            <article class="advantage-item">
              <span class="advantage-icon">01</span>
              <div>
                <h3>需求洞察</h3>
                <p>从院校实际需求与产业发展趋势出发，建立清晰的项目目标。</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="advantage-item">
              <span class="advantage-icon">02</span>
              <div>
                <h3>系统规划</h3>
                <p>统筹专业、课程、师资、平台与运营，避免服务内容彼此割裂。</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="advantage-item">
              <span class="advantage-icon">03</span>
              <div>
                <h3>项目实施</h3>
                <p>将规划转化为可执行的工作内容，持续支持项目建设与优化。</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="advantage-item">
              <span class="advantage-icon">04</span>
              <div>
                <h3>内容传播</h3>
                <p>通过官网、公众号和视频号形成内容协同，沉淀长期品牌价值。</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" id="insights">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
          <h2>通过专业内容，持续分享教育创新实践</h2>
          <p>原网站代表文章、培训信息和视频内容可集中在这里展示。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-grid">
          <article class="content-card">
            <span>代表文章 / 行业观察</span>
            <h3>职业教育与产教融合的实践思考</h3>
            <p>使用原网站真实文章标题、摘要和封面图片替换当前内容。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="content-card accent">
            <span>公众号与视频号</span>
            <h3>关注最新动态</h3>
            <p>电脑端展示二维码，手机端提供可直接跳转或复制的访问入口。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <div>
            <h2>让我们从一次深入沟通开始</h2>
            <p>如果您正在规划相关项目，欢迎与早舟科技交流实际需求。</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:">联系业务顾问</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-row">
      <span>© 重庆市早舟科技有限公司</span>
      <span>实际地址、电话、邮箱及备案信息使用原网站内容替换</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
